	(text "- All security-critical operations run on the STM32F469 MCU\n- QR scanner only captures images; no crypto processing\n- Smartcard communication is encrypted end-to-end\n- Power latch (PWR_EN) ensures clean shutdown with filesystem sync\n- Battery monitoring via I2C fuel gauge or ADC voltage divider\n- Original design: Altium CircuitMaker by Mikhail Tolkachev\n- Source: github.com/3rdIteration/specter-diy"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
